        "original_id": "5021770b-2d79-54f0-b75e-bba7fc57c29f",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jamal Igle, Geoff Johns, James Robinson, Sterling Gates, Gary Frank, Alex Ross, Renato Guedes, Pete Woods\n- Characters: Firestorm, Killer Frost, Supergirl\n- Organizations: DC Comics, Justice League of America\n- Works: Molly Danger, Superman: New Krypton\n- Topics: DC Rebirth\n\nFacts:\n- Firestorm is the name of several fictional superheroes appearing in American comic books published by DC Comics.\n- In 2008 and 2009, Superman: New Krypton was a Superman story arc published by DC Comics.\n- Superman: New Krypton was written by Geoff Johns, James Robinson, and Sterling Gates.\n- Superman: New Krypton featured art by Gary Frank, Alex Ross, Renato Guedes, Jamal Igle, and Pete Woods.\n- Jamal Igle is the creator of the comic book series Molly Danger.\n- Jamal Igle is also known for pencilling, inking, and coloring work on books such as Supergirl and Firestorm.\n- In 2016, DC Rebirth started a new Justice League of America.\n- Killer Frost formerly appeared as an adversary of Firestorm.\n- Killer Frost is now a member of the Justice League of America that started with DC Rebirth in 2016.",
